  "title": "When Does the Newborn Stage End? A guide from a pediatrician",
  "summary": "Summary: In this article, you'll learn about the newborn stage, which spans from birth to approximately three months, and the key developmental milestones during this period. Understanding when the newborn stage ends helps parents prepare for the transition to the next phase of their baby's growth, recognizing the unique challenges and joys that come with these early months.",
